<p><strong><%= mail_safe(@event.name) %></strong> is set.</p>
<p><%= @recipient_window %></p>
<% if @recipient_window != @event_window %><p>In the event's zone: <%= @event_window %></p><% end %>
<% if @place %><p>Where: <%= @place %></p><% end %>
<% if @duration %><p>How long: <%= @duration %></p><% end %>
<% if @plan.any? %>
<p>Plan:</p>
<ol>
<% @plan.each do |line| %>
  <li><%= line %></li>
<% end %>
</ol>
<% end %>
<% if @link %>
<p>Open your link for the details:</p>
<p><%= link_to @link, @link %></p>
<% else %>
<p>Open your organizer link for the details.</p>
<% end %>
<p>The attached calendar file adds it to your calendar with a reminder, one tap from the mail.</p>
<p>You will hear from us again only if the organizer changes the plan, reopens the time or cancels.</p>
<% if @link %><p>To stop hearing about this event, open your link and choose Leave this event.</p><% end %>
